  "description": "Two legendary sword clans are lifelong rivals. A former detective is reborn as the treasured daughter of one clan, only to be betrothed to the heir of the other to force a truce. At the engagement she meets someone tied to her past life, and the rival remembers that past as well. Jealousy from powerful allies turns the political match into a perilous, slow-burn enemies-to-lovers game.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68099894), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9B%90%EC%88%98%EB%8A%94-%EC%95%BD%ED%98%BC%EC%8B%9D%EC%9E%A5%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%82%9C%EB%8B%A4/4721) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/i-met-my-enemy-at-the-engagement-party/list?title_no=9913), [Japanese](https://mechacomic.jp/books/251600), [B.Portuguese](https://br.comikey.com/comics/meu-noivo-e-meu-arqui-inimigo-webtoon/949/)",
